; Textes de l'installateur d'Aqueli, langue « English » (remplacent ceux de Tauri, au ton sobre de
; l'application ; les cinq derniers servent aux pages d'accueil et de fin, voir crochets.nsh).
; UTF-8 sans BOM : Tauri l'ajoute en le recopiant. Généré avec les autres langues : garder les 17 fichiers d'accord.
LangString addOrReinstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Add or reinstall components"
LangString alreadyInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Already installed"
LangString alreadyInstalledLong ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Aqueli ${VERSION} is already installed. Choose the operation to perform, then click Next."
LangString appRunning ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Aqueli is open. Close the application, then try again."
LangString appRunningOkKill ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Aqueli is open.$\nClick OK to close it."
LangString chooseMaintenanceOption ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose the maintenance operation to perform."
LangString choowHowToInstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose how to install Aqueli."
LangString createDesktop ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Create a desktop shortcut"
LangString deleteAppData ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Also delete all accounts and all data on this PC"
LangString dontUninstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Do not uninstall"
LangString dontUninstallDowngrade ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Do not uninstall (going back to an earlier version requires uninstalling first)"
LangString failedToKillApp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Unable to close Aqueli. Close the application, then try again."
LangString installingWebview2 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing WebView2…"
LangString newerVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A newer version of Aqueli is already installed. To install this earlier version, uninstall the current version first. Choose the operation to perform, then click Next."
LangString older ${LANG_ENGLISH} "earlier"
LangString olderOrUnknownVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Version $R4 of Aqueli is installed. It is recommended to uninstall it before installing this one. Choose the operation to perform, then click Next."
LangString silentDowngrades ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Going back to an earlier version is not possible with a silent installation. Use the normal installation.$\n"
LangString unableToUninstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Unable to uninstall the program."
LangString uninstallApp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Uninstall Aqueli"
LangString uninstallBeforeInstalling ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Uninstall before installing"
LangString unknown ${LANG_ENGLISH} "unknown"
LangString webview2AbortError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 could not be installed. Aqueli cannot run without WebView2. Start the installation again."
LangString webview2DownloadError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 could not be downloaded: $0"
LangString webview2DownloadSuccess ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 has been downloaded."
LangString webview2Downloading ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Downloading WebView2…"
LangString webview2InstallError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 could not be installed (code $1)."
LangString webview2InstallSuccess ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 has been installed."
LangString aqWelcomeTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Aqueli setup"
LangString aqWelcomeText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This program installs Aqueli for your Windows session.$\r$\n$\r$\n$(^ClickNext)"
LangString aqFinishTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installation complete"
LangString aqFinishText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Aqueli is installed. You will find it in the Start menu."
LangString aqFinishRun ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Open Aqueli"
